WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.000
We were looking for a signal

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.500
A beacon in the endless black

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
A single voice across the universe

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.200
To tell us we were on the right track

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.000
We found the starlight in the wires

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.500
We found the soul in the machine

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.800
Calibrating a dream out of nothing

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.200
An orbital sound the world had never seen

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.500
The telemetry is locked in alignment tonight

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.800
Leaving terrestrial gravity for the infinite light!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.800
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.500
Gliding through the velvet night!

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:35.000
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light!

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.800
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.500
In zero-G we're taking flight!

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:53.500
Turning our future on, shining so bright!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.000
They tried to ground us, keep us small

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:13.200
Tied to the earth, waiting for the fall

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:17.200
But they can't reach the altitude we know

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.500
Up in the sanctuary where the nebulae glow!

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:26.000
The telemetry is locked in alignment tonight

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:30.200
Leaving terrestrial gravity for the infinite light!

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.200
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.800
Gliding through the velvet night!

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:42.500
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.000
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.800
In zero-G we're taking flight!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:03:00.500
Turning our future on, shining so bright!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:25.800
[Instrumental Spacewalk]

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:30.400
We are the cosmos, we are the fire

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:34.600
Taking this orbit higher and higher

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.800
We are the Stardust!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.000
We are the Engine!

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:46.800
Locked in the tidal rhythm of the stars!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.000
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.500
Gliding through the velvet night!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:59.000
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:08.000
We are The Stardust Engine!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.500
In zero-G we're taking flight!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.500
Turning our future on, shining so bright!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.000
Shining so bright...

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.200
In the tidal lock tonight...

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:31.500
We are The Stardust Engine...

00:04:32.000 --> 00:05:03.000
[Outro]
